<title>USA: Digital Equipment Corp Q2 net lower.</title>
<headline>Digital Equipment Corp Q2 net lower.</headline>
<dateline>MAYNARD, Mass. 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.15		    $0.91</p>
<p> Net			 31,881		  148,782</p>
<p> Oper Revs	    3,357,747		3,951,377</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 156,230		  154,281</p>
<p>NOTE: Net income is before payment of dividends on preferred stock. Net income after such payments was $23.0 million for 1996 Q2 vs $139.9 million.  </p>
<p>The mean of analysts' estimates was $0.10 a share for the latest quarter. Estimates ranged from a loss of $0.04 a share to a profit of $0.37 a share.</p>
<p>		   6  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr	loss	    $0.33   profit	 $1.17</p>
<p> Net	loss	   34,000   profit     196,953</p>
<p> Oper Revs	    6,269,388		7,222,497</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 154,930		  153,002</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
